yle=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">1. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: 3,4</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년 재학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">졸업유예자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기초과자 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span></strong></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">※ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">ICT </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">관련학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">전자공학계열</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">컴퓨터계열</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" s